                    "strong"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "_key": "k51",
                  "_type": "span",
                  "text": ": after the Income-tax Rules, 2026, these are worth up to ₹72,000 and ₹2,16,000 a year for two children. If you have kids in school, these are the easiest exemptions in the old regime.",
